// Mining the same rock with each tool tier: higher tiers clear it in fewer ticks.
// Each block mines a different rock column 2 cells right of @ (row of feet).
map
##############################
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#.@.rrrr.....................#
##############################
end
// Sandstone (`r`) takes claws 49 ticks a bite and the bore 13 (`examples/digtempo.rs`).
tool 1 0
mine 1-55 2 0
expect 55 is:2,0,Rock == 0
tool 56 3
mine 56-70 3 0
expect 70 is:3,0,Rock == 0
dump 70
